$$ 
$$ # 1 "/u/exp/stan/nmr/lists/pp//Grad.incl"
$$ ;Grad.incl  -  include file for Gradient Spectroscopy
$$ ;avance-version
$$ ;version 99/02/19
$$ 
$$ 
$$ 
$$ 
$$ 
